{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":5},"C'è di nuovo la valigia sul letto","Il film è ambientato in Cilento e racconta la nuova missione impossibile di Achille il \"vuttazziello intofato\", Brigida \"'a purpetta\", l'inafferabile \"Antimo fuggente\", tra risate e sentimenti. Dopo 10 anni dal precedente capitolo, si imbatteranno in una emergenza nazionale che li vedrà affrontare i servizi segreti, la criminalità organizzata e una montagna di denaro.",[4],"organized crime",{"type":6,"id":7,"slug":8,"title":9,"release":11,"filmType":15,"directors":16,"genre":25,"media":28,"synopsis":31,"production":32,"characters":35,"roles":55,"awards":74,"tags":3},"Film","IT2023_075","it2023-075-c-e-di-nuovo-la-valigia-sul-letto",{"native":1,"english":10},"",{"type":12,"date":13,"year":14},"Theatrical release","2023-06-08",2023,"Fiction film",[17],{"id":18,"slug":19,"name":18,"birthYear":20,"deathYear":21,"gender":22,"nationality":23,"awards":24},"Eduardo Tartaglia","eduardo-tartaglia",1965,0,"Male identifying","Italy",[],[26,27],"Comedy","Crime",{"posterUrl":29,"trailerUrl":30},"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt24121388/mediaviewer/rm2119442945/?ref_=tt_ov_i","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TPXL6Q2bbDs",{"native":2,"english":10},[33],{"country":23,"share":34},"Majority coproducer",[36,47],{"id":37,"film":7,"person":38,"age":40,"gender":22,"sexuality":41,"origin":42,"class":43,"profession":44,"ability":45,"assistedMobility":46},"IT2023_075_01",{"id":18,"slug":19,"name":18,"birthYear":20,"deathYear":21,"gender":22,"nationality":23,"awards":39},[],"2: Late Middle Age (55-60)","Heterosexual","White Western European","Lower Middle class","Self-employed","Able-bodied","No",{"id":48,"film":7,"person":49,"age":54,"gender":22,"sexuality":41,"origin":42,"class":43,"profession":44,"ability":45,"assistedMobility":46},"IT2023_075_02",{"id":50,"slug":51,"name":50,"birthYear":52,"deathYear":21,"gender":22,"nationality":23,"awards":53},"Biagio Izz